---
import AssessmentsGrid from "../../components/AssessmentsGrid.astro";
import { courseMeta } from "../../course-config";
import CourseLayout from "../../layouts/CourseLayout.astro";
---

<CourseLayout
  title="Assignments"
  description="Three formal assessments trace the move from precise observation to an adaptive lifelong care judgement."
  pageClass="course-shell-page"
>
  <section class="shell-hero shell-hero--assignments" aria-labelledby="assignments-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">{courseMeta.code} · Assessment</p>
      <h1 id="assignments-title">Show how your judgement changed</h1>
    </div>
    <p>
      The course does not reward a pile of remembered cat facts. It asks for a record of what you
      noticed, how you tested an interpretation, and why the care decision that followed is safe.
    </p>
  </section>

  <AssessmentsGrid />

  <aside class="formative-note" aria-labelledby="formative-note-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Practice without penalty</p>
    <h2 id="formative-note-title">Chapter Checks remain formative</h2>
    <p>
      The seven-question check at the end of each Capture helps you revise your reasoning. It does
      not contribute to the formal assessment percentage and is not submitted for a mark.
    </p>
  </aside>
</CourseLayout>
